22283,XYL-PPBL,master,Black Da-Lite Flip Chart,Black Da-Lite Flip Chart,17,198,0,,"* Our Da-Lite Paper Pad flip chart is the presenter’s choice for versatility and convenience<br> <EOL>* This lightweight flip chart features aluminum construction with reinforced corners for added stability<br> <EOL>* Plus, it's versatile enough to hold either flip chart pads or single flip chart pages and charts<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>* Best of all, the straighforward design of the Da-Lite Paper Pad flip chart helps it fold easily and compactly for quick transport or storage<br> <EOL>* Available in your choice of two durable finishes, this is one flip chart that will withstand years of constant use<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Features:</b><br> <EOL>* Fingertip hinge releases make for quick, easy set-up<br> <EOL>* Flip chart folds compactly to 38""H X 28""W X 3 1/2""<br> <EOL>* Lightweight aluminum construction features reinforced corners for added stability<br> <EOL>* Holds either standard flip chart pads or single flip chart pages and charts<br> <EOL>* Flip chart available in two rugged finishes: black or beige anodized aluminum<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Specifications:</b><br> <EOL><b>Height:</b><br> <EOL>* Height of easel: 68 1/2""<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Surface Area:</b><br> <EOL>* Height: 38""<br> <EOL>* Width: 28""<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Footprint:</b><br> <EOL>* Width: 28 3/4""<br> <EOL>* Depth: 31 1/2""<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Shelf:</b><br> <EOL>* Height from floor: 31 1/2""<br> <EOL>* Width: 28""<br> <EOL>* Depth: 1""<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Colors:</b> Misty Beige, Black<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>* Shipping Cart Dimensions: 42 1/2"" x 33 1/2"" x 7""",,0,2,N,0.010,N,,1,0,0,0,10,Y,58225,Uncategorized/Other crafts,,195.400,,Wednesday 21 May 2008 07:24:29 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,157,,158.400,0,N,13,Xylem Design
22134,XYL-FFEBL,master,Black Finished Field Easel: 68" x 27" x 25",Black Finished Field Easel: 68" x 27" x 25",5,49.500,0,,"<b>Looking for a respectable yet affordable collapsible wood painter's easel?</b><br> <EOL>* Xylem Design has a reputation for doing things better, and to prove it we've even improved an old standby - the classic inexpensive tripod easel<br> <EOL>* We've given the easel thicker leg stock, with full 6-foot continuous legs, so you don't have to hassle with little wing nuts to put the legs together<br> <EOL>* We've also added our patented Xylem Leg Lock System that holds the legs to eliminate wobble<br> <EOL>* We've got a better-engineered apex to improve longevity and a hold-down clamp to secure your work<br> <EOL>* Compare our easel to others and we're sure you'll find ours is the best value<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Features:</b><br> <EOL>* Patented Leg-Lock system dramatically improves stability<br> <EOL>* Leg-Lock greatly increases useful life of easel by reducing stress on top assembly area<br> <EOL>* Superior leg design - smoother, thicker, and stronger than others<br> <EOL>* Includes top hold-down clamp to secure signage or artwork<br> <EOL>* Easily adjustable tray for a wide range of work configurations<br> <EOL>* Knock-down design for easy transport<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Specifications</b><br> <EOL><b>Height:</b><br> <EOL>* Height of easel: 68""<br> <EOL>* Height of shelf from floor: Adjustable: 16"" to 55""<br> <EOL>* Width of Shelf: 22""<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Footprint:</b><br> <EOL>* Width: 27""<br> <EOL>* Depth: 25""<br> <EOL>* Diagonal Depth: 27""<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Maximum Image Size:</b><br> <EOL>* Height: 36""<br> <EOL>* Width: 48""<br> <EOL>* Depth: 1 1/2""<br> <EOL>* Weight Capacity of Easel: 10 lbs<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Colors:</b><br> Natural Oak, Black Oak, Unfinished<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>* Shipping Carton Dimensions: 71"" 5"" 2""",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,,1,71,5,2,10,Y,57737,Easels/Outdoor and Plein Air Easels,,62.510,,Saturday 1