22127,XYL-GINGERBL-70,master,Black Ginger Easel: 70" Height,Black Ginger Easel: 70" Height,18,169,0,,"* Charming and whimsical, our shapely and well-proportioned Ginger creates a delightful presence, setting a striking pose wherever she finds herself<br> <EOL>* Ever light-hearted, she'll add character and fun to your boutique, boudoir, salon, or specialty shop<br> <EOL>* The tapered curl of the hand-forged finials reflect an attention to style and detail absent in machine-produced, ""stamped out"" products<br> <EOL>* The Ginger features two piece body construction for more compact shipping<br> <EOL>* Minimal assembly is required (2 parts)<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Features:</b><br> <EOL>* Lifetime structural guarantee<br> <EOL>* Rigid rear leg brace makes easel extra stable<br> <EOL>* Sliding pegs make hand adjustment a snap<br> <EOL>* Carefully welded joints create a solid joint and visual appeal<br> <EOL>* Solid steel construction takes serious abuse<br> <EOL>* Hand - ground surface texture creates a rich beauty that regular ""stamped-out"" easels lack<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Specifications:</b><br> <EOL><b>Height:</b><br> <EOL>* Height of easel: 70""<br> <EOL>* Height of Shelf from the floor: Adjustable, 16"" to 36""<br> <EOL>* Peg to Peg Width: 17"" average<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Footprint:</b><br> <EOL>* Width: 17""<br> <EOL>* Depth: 18""<br> <EOL>* Diagonal depth: 20""<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Maximum Image Size:</b><br> <EOL>* Height: 44""<br> <EOL>* Width: 48""<br> <EOL>* Depth: 3""<br> <EOL>* Weight Capacity of Easel: 90 lbs<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Colors:</b><br> Black, Brushed Silver<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>* Shipping Carton Dimensions: 73"" length, 129"" length + girth",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,,1,129,73,44,10,Y,57287,Easels/Aluminum and Metal Easels,,204.680,,Friday 16 May 2008 09:16:03 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,157,,126.750,0,N,13,Xylem Design
