22138,XYL-CAFR,master,Carved French Easel Brown Wax: 69" Height x 23" Width x 25" Depth,Carved French Easel Brown Wax: 69" Height x 23" Width x 25" Depth,29,469,0,,"* This beautiful French easel is handcrafted in Indonesia<br> <EOL>* The craftsman, Karman, has been creating beautiful antique furniture reproductions for many years, using age-old carving techniques<br> <EOL>* The genuine Bolivian mahogany was originally planted as decorative shading trees and wind breaks around teak plantations<br> <EOL>* Great time and care is taken to dry and protect this wood before the easel begins to take shape<br> <EOL>* This French display easel is reminiscent of Louis XV<br> <EOL>* Minor distressing gives these pieces a look of authenticity<br> <EOL>* Each easel will have its own unique character<br> <EOL>* The overall appearance is beautifully authentic<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Features:</b><br> <EOL>* Hand-carved in Indonesia by a highly skilled craftsman<br> <EOL>* Available in a Brown Wax finish or in Gold Leafing<br> <EOL>* Classic French design for the discerning collector<br> <EOL>* Shelf adjusts to accommodate a variety of display sizes<br> <EOL>* Plantation-grown Java Swietania Mahogany is kiln dried for 3 weeks, then stored in a chamber for 3 days to prevent expanding and cracking<br> <EOL>* Each easel takes one full day to carve<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Specifications:</b><br> <EOL><b>Height:</b><br> <EOL>* Height of easel: 69""<br> <EOL>* Height of pegs from the floor: Adjustable, 20""to 43""<br> <EOL>* Shelf width: 24""<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Footprint:</b><br> <EOL>* Width: 23""<br> <EOL>* Depth: 28""<br> <EOL>* Diagonal Depth: 25""<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Maximum Image Size:</b><br> <EOL>* Height: 39""<br> <EOL>* Width: 48""<br> <EOL>* Depth: 2 1/2""<br> <EOL>* Weight Capacity: 20 lbs<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Colors:</b> Hand rubbed, very dark, antique mahogany<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>* Shipping Carton Dimensions: 72"" x 26"" x 6""<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Please Note:</b><br> <EOL