22550,XYL-PD184,ariel2,Custom Pedestal #184,Custom Pedestal #184,35,495,0,,"<b>A lighted turntable designed to accentuate an object that is already elevated</b><br> <EOL><br> <EOL>* Our pedestals elegantly display sculpture, pottery, models, and more<br> <EOL>* Each pedestal is individually crafted at the factory and fully assembled<br> <EOL>* Most pedestals are available in a range of finishes and colors, including Formica, Laminart, Pionite, Nevamar, Wilsonart, metal finishes, and mirror finishes<br> <EOL>* In most cases, pedestals can be built to custom sizes or crafted with motorized turntables and/orlighting effects<br> <EOL>* Please call for details<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Features:</b><br> <EOL>* This lighted pedestal is electric with cord<br> <EOL>* Acrylic pedestals are made of 3/16 solid high-gloss acrylic<br> <EOL>* Chemically fused or welded corner construction—joint is carefully aligned then a solvent is introduced that fuses the two parts, literally forming a continious weld, not just a surface glue joint<br> <EOL>* Wood and formica type pesistals are made of mdf meduim density fiberboard, 3/4 inch<br> <EOL>* 75 lb. capacity<br> <EOL>* Call for quote if display piece is heavier<br> <EOL>* All pedestals are guaranteed against any defects in craftsmanship but are not returnable, so please make your selections carefully<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Specifications:</b><br> <EOL>* Lighted<br> <EOL>* Turntable<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Height:</b><br> <EOL>* Height of pedestal: 7""<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Footprint:</b><br> <EOL>* Width: 12"" x 15""<br /><br /> <EOL><div style=""border: 2px solid blue; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px""> <EOL><strong>Note:</strong><br /> <EOL><em>This pedestal is custom made, therefore all sales are final and no returns or exchanges are allowed.</em></div>",,10000,0,Y,0.010,N,,1,15,12,7,10,Y,54362,Furniture for Artists/Pedestals,,814.330,,Monday 26 May 2008 04:36:44 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,157,,508.610,0,N,13,Xylem Design
