22213,XYL-FBWGRBL2,master,Green Metal Blackboard 18" x 22": Easel Not Included,Green Metal Blackboard 18" x 22": Easel Not Included,10,175,0,,"<b>Each frame is individually welded to ensure strength and rigidity and then carefully textured by hand</b><br> <EOL><br> <EOL>* We accent the steel's unique qualities with a surface treatment that reacts with the steel, followed by a hand-applied topcoat to seal in the color<br> <EOL>* This process creates a rich dimension that dramatically enhances the final finish<br> <EOL>* The three finishes can be selected to match or contrast beautifully with our broad line of wrought iron easels<br> <EOL>* The blackboard surface is a perfect match, both in tone and texture<br> <EOL>* Also available with an erasable whiteboard<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Features:</b><br> <EOL>* The Bungee Backer Security cord helps prevent knockovers due to wind and elbows<br> <EOL>* The cord stretches behind the easel, and can be used in the vertical or horizontal position<br> <EOL>* Available in Green, Brushed Silver, Antique Black, and Rust Patina<br> <EOL>* Individually hand-welded and finished<br> <EOL>* Available with markerboard or blackboard<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Specifications:</b><br> <EOL><b>Maximum Image Size:</b><br> <EOL>* Height: 22""<br> <EOL>* Width: 30""<br> <EOL>* Depth: 1 1/2""<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Colors:</b> <EOL>* Rust, Silver, Black",,0,0,N,0.010,N,,1,0,0,0,10,Y,58225,Uncategorized/Other crafts,,207.060,,Tuesday 20 May 2008 02:16:33 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,157,,140,0,N,13,Xylem Design
